msgstr "マニホールドレーンベルト使用"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(29)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoConnectDistributors.TT"
msgid "Chain distributors together with manifold lane belts, so a whole row is fed from one input."
msgstr "分配機同士をマニホールドレーンベルトで連結し、列全体を1つの入力から供給します。"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(26)
